  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><div><p>Buy and sell GPUs with verified counterparties and price discovery.</p></div><div><div><p>Supply is scattered</p><div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 380px, (min-width: 810px) 30vw, 90vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-01-scattered.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p><p>OEM allocation, cloud capacity, brokers, operators, and secondary sellers each expose a different slice of the market.</p></div></div><div><p>Price depends on context</p><div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"407\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 380px, (min-width: 810px) 30vw, 90vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fshared-supply-02-price-context.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p><p>SKU, delivery timing, region, quantity, condition, financing, and urgency all change where GPUs actually clear.</p></div></div><div><p>Signals are incomplete</p><div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 380px, (min-width: 810px) 30vw, 90vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-supply-03-signals-incomplete.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p><p>Buyers and sellers still rely on private quotes, stale lists, and partial broker color to see where hardware actually clears.</p></div></div></div><div><div><p>Product</p><h2>Supply, pricing, and execution in one venue.</h2></div><p>Price GPU supply, discover clearing levels, and execute GPU transactions with verified counterparties.</p></div><div><div><div><p>How it works</p><h2>From RFQ to settled trade.</h2></div><p>One structured path through the market - every step explicit, every step on record.</p></div><ol><li><div><p>Describe the trade</p><p>Describe the hardware in plain language or attach a quote PDF. AI drafts the RFQ - you stay in control of every field.</p></div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 480px, (min-width: 810px) 45vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-01-describe.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></li><li><div><p>Review and send</p><p>Terms, delivery, and deadlines are explicit before anything goes out. Accepting a quote creates a binding trade.</p></div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 480px, (min-width: 810px) 45vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-02-review-send.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></li><li><div><p>Execute at a firm price</p><p>Verified dealers respond with firm quotes. Accept, and the trade executes with grade, condition, and verification expectations on record.</p></div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 480px, (min-width: 810px) 45vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-03-execute.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></li><li><div><p>Settle step by step</p><p>Settlement runs on a recorded timeline: confirmed, payment, shipped, delivered, inspected, settled, with evidence required along the way.</p></div><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1200px) 480px, (min-width: 810px) 45vw, 100vw\" srcset=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/_next/image?url=%2Fredesign%2Fhome-howitworks-04-settle.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"></p></li></ol></div><div><div><p>GPU Market</p><h2>Built for every side of the GPU market.</h2></div><div><div><p>GPU Brokers &amp; dealers</p><p>Match supply with verified demand and see clearing levels.</p></div><div><p>Data center operators</p><p>Sell surplus, price hardware, and plan fleet rotations.</p></div><div><p>AI labs &amp; enterprises</p><p>Find available GPUs and compare offers by SKU and region.</p></div><div><p>Cloud &amp; neoclouds</p><p>Acquire capacity, place excess supply, and track market color.</p></div><div><p>OEMs, VARs &amp; SIs</p><p>Route allocation, secondary supply, and enterprise demand.</p></div><div><p>Resellers &amp; liquidators</p><p>Move used, refurbished, and recovered GPUs to verified buyers.</p></div><div><p>Lenders &amp; lessors</p><p>Evaluate collateral, lease exposure, and liquidation paths.</p></div><div><p>Funds &amp; capital partners</p><p>Underwrite GPU-backed trades and supply-side financing.</p></div></div></div><div><div><h2>A market built for trust.</h2><p>Stop choosing between market reach and counterparty risk. Stoa gives you both sides - access and structure.</p></div><div><div><ul><li><span>Verified counterparties on every trade</span></li><li><span>Firm quotes you can act on</span></li><li><span>Clearing levels across the whole market</span></li><li><span>Payment held until delivery confirms</span></li><li><span>Clean records from RFQ to delivery</span></li></ul><a href=\"https://www.stoaexchange.com/signup\">Request access to Stoa Markets</a></div><div><p>Off-market trading</p><div><ul><li><span>Unverified buyers and sellers</span></li><li><span>Indications, not firm prices</span></li><li><span>Partial view from private broker color</span></li><li><span>Wire-and-hope settlement risk</span></li><li><span>Deals scattered across DMs and spreadsheets</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div>",
